('1045468501003016951', 'Bibles + beach tee - XL', 'Bible + beach = the perfect summer day! COMFORT COLORS ivory Preshrunk, soft-washed, garment-dyed fabric 100% cotton If you are looking for more of an oversized fit, I\'d recommend going up 1-2 sizes. This t-shirt is unisex and true to size. I\'m wearing a large in the photo :) The measurements taken above are of the garment laying flat. Width: Measure across the chest (1” below armhole) and straight across from side seam to side seam. Length: Measure in a straight line from shoulder down to botto', 'https://personalhypegirl.com/products/bibles-beach-tee?variant=46530764243169', 'https://www.pinterest.com/pin/1045468501003016951', 'https://i.pinimg.com/originals/83/81/49/83814983b53665dd9093061ee9695df4.jpg', '60x60: https://i.pinimg.com/60x60/83/81/49/83814983b53665dd9093061ee9695df4.jpg\n136x136: https://i.pinimg.com/136x136/83/81/49/83814983b53665dd9093061ee9695df4.jpg\n170x: https://i.pinimg.com/236x/83/81/49/83814983b53665dd9093061ee9695df4.jpg\n236x: https://i.pinimg.com/236x/83/81/49/83814983b53665dd9093061ee9695df4.jpg\n474x: https://i.pinimg.com/474x/83/81/49/83814983b53665dd9093061ee9695df4.jpg\n564x: https://i.pinimg.com/564x/83/81/49/83814983b53665dd9093061ee9695df4.jpg\n736x: https://i.pinimg.com/736x/83/81/49/83814983b53665dd9093061ee9695df4.jpg\n600x315: https://i.pinimg.com/600x315/83/81/49/83814983b53665dd9093061ee9695df4.jpg\norig: https://i.pinimg.com/originals/83/81/49/83814983b53665dd9093061ee9695df4.jpg', '', '', '', 601, 0, '25', 482, 2, 0, 8, 'Products', 'https://www.pinterest.com/personalhypegirl/_products/', 0, 0, '', 'protected', 'products', 'Personal Hype Girl', 'personalhypegirl', 'https://www.pinterest.com/personalhypegirl', 0, 0, 1124, 0, '', '', '', '', '2025-06-07T14:45:51.000Z', '2026-06-23T17:14:35.589Z', '', 'created', 0, ''),
('1045961082208414689', 'Summer 2025 Beach Outfit Ideas 👗🌞 | Floral Dresses, Resort Looks & Vacation Style Inspo', 'Soak up the sunshine in style with this gorgeous Summer 2025 beach outfit idea featuring a flowy floral wrap dress, woven accessories, and breezy resort vibes. Perfect for beach strolls, boat days, and tropical getaways, this look is all about effortless elegance and seasonal comfort. Save this pin for your next coastal vacation packing inspo! 🌴👒\n#summerbeachoutfits #beachstyletrends2025 #vacationready #floraldress #bohobeachwear #summervibes #coastalfashion #beachlookbook', 'https://women-lifstyle.com/fashion/summer-beach-outfit-20-ideas-the-style-guide-youll-actually-want-to-pack.html', 'https://www.pinterest.com/pin/1045961082208414689', 'https://i.pinimg.com/originals/bf/78/79/bf7879c398af37fbdf0eb567665d22e6.jpg', '60x60: https://i.pinimg.com/60x60/bf/78/79/bf7879c398af37fbdf0eb567665d22e6.jpg\n136x136: https://i.pinimg.com/136x136/bf/78/79/bf7879c398af37fbdf0eb567665d22e6.jpg\n170x: https://i.pinimg.com/236x/bf/78/79/bf7879c398af37fbdf0eb567665d22e6.jpg\n236x: https://i.pinimg.com/236x/bf/78/79/bf7879c398af37fbdf0eb567665d22e6.jpg\n474x: https://i.pinimg.com/474x/bf/78/79/bf7879c398af37fbdf0eb567665d22e6.jpg\n564x: https://i.pinimg.com/564x/bf/78/79/bf7879c398af37fbdf0eb567665d22e6.jpg\n736x: https://i.pinimg.com/736x/bf/78/79/bf7879c398af37fbdf0eb567665d22e6.jpg\n600x315: https://i.pinimg.com/600x315/bf/78/79/bf7879c398af37fbdf0eb567665d22e6.jpg\norig: https://i.pinimg.com/originals/bf/78/79/bf7879c398af37fbdf0eb567665d22e6.jpg', '', '', '', 1, 0, '0', 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Summer 2025 Beach Outfit 20 Ideas: The Style Guide', 'https://www.pinterest.com/WomenLifestyleBlog/summer-2025-beach-outfit-20-ideas-the-style-guide/', 0, 0, '', 'public', '', 'Women Lifestyle ⭐ Inspiration | Hairstyles | Nails | Outfits', 'WomenLifestyleBlog', 'https://www.pinterest.com/WomenLifestyleBlog', 0, 0, 5717, 0, '', '', '', '', '2025-04-10T14:17:13.000Z', '2026-06-23T17:13