('1046101819717249165', 'Blue Boho Women\'s Vacation Beach Two-Piece Set | Color: Blue | Size: Various', 'Embrace A Carefree Boho Vibe With This Blue Vacation Beach Twopiece Set, Featuring A Breezy Halterneck Camisole And Relaxed Long Pants. The Sleeveless Top Offers A Lightweight, Unlined Feel Perfect For Sunny Days, While The Loosefit Trousers Provide Effortless Movement And A Flowing Silhouette. Ideal For Seaside Strolls Or Resort Evenings, The Ensemble Blends Coastal Charm With Relaxed Style, Making It A Versatile Addition To Any Warmweather Wardrobe. 97% Polyester,3% Elastane Non-Stretch Loose True-To-Size Boutique Brand Tags Are Letters: Xs=0 S=2/4 M=6 L=8/10 Xl=12 1x=14 2x=16 3x=18 4x=20 This Item Ships Out In Approx In 4-9 Days', 'https://go.skimresources.com/?id=291659X1778746&url=https://poshmark.com/listing/Blue-Boho-Womens-Vacation-Beach-TwoPiece-Set-6a17802d134ddb0565a7a984%3Futm_source%3Dpin_unpaid&xcust=scale', 'https://www.pinterest.com/pin/1046101819717249165', 'https://i.pinimg.com/originals/40/0f/08/400f08bdf782a86ceec831afd8f265fb.jpg', '60x60: https://i.pinimg.com/60x60/40/0f/08/400f08bdf782a86ceec831afd8f265fb.jpg\n136x136: https://i.pinimg.com/136x136/40/0f/08/400f08bdf782a86ceec831afd8f265fb.jpg\n170x: https://i.pinimg.com/236x/40/0f/08/400f08bdf782a86ceec831afd8f265fb.jpg\n236x: https://i.pinimg.com/236x/40/0f/08/400f08bdf782a86ceec831afd8f265fb.jpg\n474x: https://i.pinimg.com/474x/40/0f/08/400f08bdf782a86ceec831afd8f265fb.jpg\n564x: https://i.pinimg.com/564x/40/0f/08/400f08bdf782a86ceec831afd8f265fb.jpg\n736x: https://i.pinimg.com/736x/40/0f/08/400f08bdf782a86ceec831afd8f265fb.jpg\n600x315: https://i.pinimg.com/600x315/40/0f/08/400f08bdf782a86ceec831afd8f265fb.jpg\norig: https://i.pinimg.com/originals/40/0f/08/400f08bdf782a86ceec831afd8f265fb.jpg', '', '', '', 2, 0, '0', 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Resort Wear', 'https://www.pinterest.com/styledream0068/resort-wear/', 0, 0, '', 'public', '', 'StyleDream', 'styledream0068', 'https://www.pinterest.com/style