('1075375217300991017', 'Boho Summer Outfits Ideas 2026 | Effortless Chic & Bohemian Vibes', 'Discover the best Boho summer outfits 2026 for effortless style! From flowy maxi dresses to breezy tops, playful skirts, and bohemian accessories, these looks are perfect for warm-weather days. Embrace the boho chic trend, layer with necklaces, and complete your outfit with sandals or ankle boots. Perfect for festivals, beach trips, or casual hangouts. Stay stylish with these bohemian summer fashion ideas!\n#BohoSummerOutfits #BohoChic2026 #BohemianStyle #SummerFashion #BohoVibes #FlowyDresses #BohoAccessories', 'https://outfitstrends.com/neutral-boho-summer-outfits-for-women-over-40/', 'https://www.pinterest.com/pin/1075375217300991017', 'https://i.pinimg.com/originals/c6/fe/f9/c6fef907c019c2dc07b059976c12e522.webp', '60x60: https://i.pinimg.com/60x60/c6/fe/f9/c6fef907c019c2dc07b059976c12e522.jpg\n136x136: https://i.pinimg.com/136x136/c6/fe/f9/c6fef907c019c2dc07b059976c12e522.jpg\n170x: https://i.pinimg.com/236x/c6/fe/f9/c6fef907c019c2dc07b059976c12e522.jpg\n236x: https://i.pinimg.com/236x/c6/fe/f9/c6fef907c019c2dc07b059976c12e522.jpg\n474x: https://i.pinimg.com/474x/c6/fe/f9/c6fef907c019c2dc07b059976c12e522.jpg\n564x: https://i.pinimg.com/564x/c6/fe/f9/c6fef907c019c2dc07b059976c12e522.jpg\n736x: https://i.pinimg.com/736x/c6/fe/f9/c6fef907c019c2dc07b059976c12e522.jpg\n600x315: https://i.pinimg.com/600x315/c6/fe/f9/c6fef907c019c2dc07b059976c12e522.jpg\norig: https://i.pinimg.com/originals/c6/fe/f9/c6fef907c019c2dc07b059976c12e522.webp', '', '', '', 15, 0, '4', 4, 0, 0, 1, 'Boho Outfit Trends 2026', 'https://www.pinterest.com/trendsoutfit19/boho-outfit-trends-2026/', 0, 0, '', 'public', '', 'Women Outfits | Hair styles | Nail designs | Fashion for everyone', 'trendsoutfit19', 'https://www.pinterest.com/trendsoutfit19', 0, 0, 66, 0, '', '', '', '', '2026-04-05T11:37:24.000Z', '2026-06-23T17:25:08.002Z', '', 'created', 0, ''),
