('1083326885395877755', 'Tides & Tassels', 'Boho soul meets beach bliss — where the ocean is your backdrop and freedom is your style.\nBarefoot on a sun-warmed shore, this look is pure wanderlust magic. A stunning tapestry halter top steals every glance with its intricate paisley and medallion embroidery in soft teal, blush, and gold tones, finished with fringe tassel trim along the hem and neckline — a true statement piece. Paired with high-waisted teal denim shorts that echo the color of the sea, the combination feels both artful and effortless. Stacked gold bangles, layered delicate necklaces, a beaded anklet, and a woven straw tote complete the free-spirited aesthetic. With palm trees swaying and waves rolling in at dusk, this outfit is made for sunset beach walks, seaside markets, and every beautiful moment in between.', '', 'https://www.pinterest.com/pin/1083326885395877755', 'https://i.pinimg.com/originals/9d/d1/1c/9dd11c2192d1d45df42a6cdcb14cdf41.jpg', '60x60: https://i.pinimg.com/60x60/9d/d1/1c/9dd11c2192d1d45df42a6cdcb14cdf41.jpg\n136x136: https://i.pinimg.com/136x136/9d/d1/1c/9dd11c2192d1d45df42a6cdcb14cdf41.jpg\n170x: https://i.pinimg.com/236x/9d/d1/1c/9dd11c2192d1d45df42a6cdcb14cdf41.jpg\n236x: https://i.pinimg.com/236x/9d/d1/1c/9dd11c2192d1d45df42a6cdcb14cdf41.jpg\n474x: https://i.pinimg.com/474x/9d/d1/1c/9dd11c2192d1d45df42a6cdcb14cdf41.jpg\n564x: https://i.pinimg.com/564x/9d/d1/1c/9dd11c2192d1d45df42a6cdcb14cdf41.jpg\n736x: https://i.pinimg.com/736x/9d/d1/1c/9dd11c2192d1d45df42a6cdcb14cdf41.jpg\n600x315: https://i.pinimg.com/600x315/9d/d1/1c/9dd11c2192d1d45df42a6cdcb14cdf41.jpg\norig: https://i.pinimg.com/originals/9d/d1/1c/9dd11c2192d1d45df42a6cdcb14cdf41.jpg', '', '', '', 1, 0, '0', 0, 0, 0, 1, 'Pins by you', 'https://www.pinterest.com/Kusumlata62016/_quick_creates/', 0, 0, '', 'public', '', 'Glow up closet', 'Kusumlata62016', 'https://www.pinterest.com/Kusumlata62016', 0, 0, 19, 0, '', '', '', '', '2026-05-23T05:27:05.000Z', '2026-06-23T17:21:46.5