('1083889835355176081', '15 Effortless Casual Beach Outfits That Look Incredible Without a Single Moment of Effort', 'The best casual beach outfit is the one that looks like you thought about it without actually thinking about it at all — that perfect combination of comfortable, stylish, and completely effortless that only a certain kind of beach dressing ever achieves. These casual beach outfits are exactly that. Soft linen shorts with a knotted button-down that looks chic from the first minute of the beach walk to the last bite of lunch, easy breezy sundresses that pair with flat sandals and immediately qualify as a complete outfit with zero accessories required, and casual beach sets in soft cotton that feel like wearing nothing but look like you planned everything.', 'https://cruiseshipmania.com/15-chic-casual-beach-outfit-ideas/', 'https://www.pinterest.com/pin/1083889835355176081', 'https://i.pinimg.com/originals/d3/e5/c5/d3e5c5d7217e289f40667f224075fb66.png', '60x60: https://i.pinimg.com/60x60/d3/e5/c5/d3e5c5d7217e289f40667f224075fb66.jpg\n136x136: https://i.pinimg.com/136x136/d3/e5/c5/d3e5c5d7217e289f40667f224075fb66.jpg\n170x: https://i.pinimg.com/236x/d3/e5/c5/d3e5c5d7217e289f40667f224075fb66.jpg\n236x: https://i.pinimg.com/236x/d3/e5/c5/d3e5c5d7217e289f40667f224075fb66.jpg\n474x: https://i.pinimg.com/474x/d3/e5/c5/d3e5c5d7217e289f40667f224075fb66.jpg\n564x: https://i.pinimg.com/564x/d3/e5/c5/d3e5c5d7217e289f40667f224075fb66.jpg\n736x: https://i.pinimg.com/736x/d3/e5/c5/d3e5c5d7217e289f40667f224075fb66.jpg\n600x315: https://i.pinimg.com/600x315/d3/e5/c5/d3e5c5d7217e289f40667f224075fb66.jpg\norig: https://i.pinimg.com/originals/d3/e5/c5/d3e5c5d7217e289f40667f224075fb66.png', '', '', '', 4, 0, '0', 3, 0, 0, 0, 'Beach Outfits', 'https://www.pinterest.com/cruiseshipmania/beach-outfits/', 0, 0, '', 'public', '', 'Cruise Tips | Travel Outfits | Women Fashion', 'cruiseshipmania', 'https://www.pinterest.com/cruiseshipmania', 0, 0, 1679, 0, '', '', '', '', '2026-06-04T06:10:41.000Z', '2026-06-23T17:12:54.463Z', '', 'created', 0, ''),
('1083889835355389576', '15 Effortlessly Cool Boho Travel Outfits That Look Incredible in Every Country You Visit', 'Boho travel style has a specific quality that makes it perfect for exploring the world — it photographs beautifully against every backdrop from Moroccan riads and Balinese temples to Tuscan vineyards and Greek island cliffs, it layers naturally for temperature changes, and it carries an effortless confidence that feels genuinely at home everywhere. These effortlessly cool boho travel outfits capture all of that with fifteen looks that pack light, travel well, and look like you dressed with intention whether you spent two minutes or twenty. Flowy tiered maxi skirts with simple fitted tops and sandals that work equally well wandering a spice market in Marrakech or a morning coffee in a Parisian courtyard.', 'https://cruiseshipmania.com/15-boho-airport-outfit-ideas/', 'https://www.pinterest.com/pin/1083889835355389576', 'https://i.pinimg.com/originals/08/4d/d1/084dd146e335ac43ddb55db5f48ea24e.png', '60x60: https://i.pinimg.com/60x60/08/4d/d1/084dd146e335ac43ddb55db5f48ea24e.jpg\n136x136: https://i.pinimg.com/136x136/08/4d/d1/084dd146e335ac43ddb55db5f48ea24e.jpg\n170x: https://i.pinimg.com/236x/08/4d/d1/084dd146e335ac43ddb55db5f48ea24e.jpg\n236x: https://i.pinimg.com/236x/08/4d/d1/084dd146e335ac43ddb55db5f48ea24e.jpg\n474x: https://i.pinimg.com/474x/08/4d/d1/084dd146e335ac43ddb55db5f48ea24e.jpg\n564x: https://i.pinimg.com/564x/08/4d/d1/084dd146e335ac43ddb55db5f48ea24e.jpg\n736x: https://i.pinimg.com/736x/08/4d/d1/084dd146e335ac43ddb55db5f48ea24e.jpg\n600x315: https://i.pinimg.com/600x315/08/4d/d1/084dd146e335ac43ddb55db5f48ea24e.jpg\norig: https://i.pinimg.com/originals/08/4d/d1/084dd146e335ac43ddb55db5f48ea24e.png', '', '', '', 1, 0, '0', 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Airport Outfits', 'https://www.pinterest.com/cruiseshipmania/airport-outfits/', 0, 0, '', 'public', '', 'Cruise Tips | Travel Outfits | Women Fashion', 'cruiseshipmania', 'https://www.pinterest.com/cruisesh