('1093108140832398396', 'Boho Summer Outfit Trends 2026 | Chic Neutral Aesthetic Fashion Inspo', 'Dreamy boho summer outfit ideas inspired by the latest American fashion trends. From flowy maxi skirts and crochet tops to relaxed linen pants and beachy layered looks, these outfits bring the perfect mix of earthy tones, coastal vibes, and effortless style. Perfect for summer vacations, beach walks, festivals, Pinterest outfit inspiration, and aesthetic fashion lovers. Neutral color palette, dry desert backgrounds, and soft bohemian styling create the ultimate trendy summer moodboard.\n\n#bohofashion #summeroutfits #bohostyle #outfitinspo #summerfashion #bohoaesthetic #fashiontrends #neutralstyle #beachoutfit #bohochic #summerstyle #aestheticoutfits #vacationoutfits #festivalfashion #pinterestfashion', '', 'https://www.pinterest.com/pin/1093108140832398396', 'https://i.pinimg.com/originals/20/1c/9a/201c9a1e763a69869265d9dae0c77756.png', '60x60: https://i.pinimg.com/60x60/20/1c/9a/201c9a1e763a69869265d9dae0c77756.jpg\n136x136: https://i.pinimg.com/136x136/20/1c/9a/201c9a1e763a69869265d9dae0c77756.jpg\n170x: https://i.pinimg.com/236x/20/1c/9a/201c9a1e763a69869265d9dae0c77756.jpg\n236x: https://i.pinimg.com/236x/20/1c/9a/201c9a1e763a69869265d9dae0c77756.jpg\n474x: https://i.pinimg.com/474x/20/1c/9a/201c9a1e763a69869265d9dae0c77756.jpg\n564x: https://i.pinimg.com/564x/20/1c/9a/201c9a1e763a69869265d9dae0c77756.jpg\n736x: https://i.pinimg.com/736x/20/1c/9a/201c9a1e763a69869265d9dae0c77756.jpg\n600x315: https://i.pinimg.com/600x315/20/1c/9a/201c9a1e763a69869265d9dae0c77756.jpg\norig: https://i.pinimg.com/originals/20/1c/9a/201c9a1e763a69869265d9dae0c77756.png', '', '', '', 7, 0, '3', 6, 0, 0, 0, 'Boho_fashion', 'https://www.pinterest.com/lucyfashionera/boho_fashion/', 0, 0, '', 'public', '', 'LucyFashionEra', 'lucyfashionera', 'https://www.pinterest.com/lucyfashionera', 0, 0, 4, 0, '', '', '', '', '2026-05-20T10:09:38.000Z', '2026-06-23T17:21:21.224Z', '', 'created', 0, ''),
