('1111685489293176396', 'Luxury Beach Vacation Outfit Inspo for the Coastal Summer 🌴🤍', 'Serving effortless resort wear energy by the beach 🐚☀️ This crochet knit sweater and breezy linen pants outfit is perfect for tropical vacations, luxury resorts, poolside walks, and chic sunset dinners ✨ Neutral tones + relaxed fits = the ultimate classy coastal grandmother aesthetic every Pinterest girl is obsessed with 💫 Save this dreamy beach vacation outfit before your next getaway 🌊\n#BeachVacationOutfits #ResortWear #CoastalGrandmother #CrochetOutfit #LinenPantsStyle #TropicalVacation #NeutralAesthetic #VacationFashion #BeachStyle #SummerOutfitIdeas', '', 'https://www.pinterest.com/pin/1111685489293176396', 'https://i.pinimg.com/originals/84/1e/0e/841e0e48b835838e06c7aaa38bcf9309.png', '60x60: https://i.pinimg.com/60x60/84/1e/0e/841e0e48b835838e06c7aaa38bcf9309.jpg\n136x136: https://i.pinimg.com/136x136/84/1e/0e/841e0e48b835838e06c7aaa38bcf9309.jpg\n170x: https://i.pinimg.com/236x/84/1e/0e/841e0e48b835838e06c7aaa38bcf9309.jpg\n236x: https://i.pinimg.com/236x/84/1e/0e/841e0e48b835838e06c7aaa38bcf9309.jpg\n474x: https://i.pinimg.com/474x/84/1e/0e/841e0e48b835838e06c7aaa38bcf9309.jpg\n564x: https://i.pinimg.com/564x/84/1e/0e/841e0e48b835838e06c7aaa38bcf9309.jpg\n736x: https://i.pinimg.com/736x/84/1e/0e/841e0e48b835838e06c7aaa38bcf9309.jpg\n600x315: https://i.pinimg.com/600x315/84/1e/0e/841e0e48b835838e06c7aaa38bcf9309.jpg\norig: https://i.pinimg.com/originals/84/1e/0e/841e0e48b835838e06c7aaa38bcf9309.png', '', '', '', 207, 0, '3', 132, 0, 0, 0, 'Summer Outfit Ideas You’ll Want to Copy ASAP ☀️✨', 'https://www.pinterest.com/AvaMitchellVibes/summer-outfit-ideas-youll-want-to-copy-asap/', 0, 0, '', 'public', '', 'Ava Mitchell | Fashion | Beauty Tips', 'AvaMitchellVibes', 'https://www.pinterest.com/AvaMitchellVibes', 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', '', '', '2026-05-09T09:00:43.000Z', '2026-06-23T17:12:36.411Z', '', 'created', 0, ''),
('11118330326836433', 'Boho Gypsy Style Clothing. Bohemian Fashion. Boho Outfit', 'Immerse yourself in the vibrant and free-spirited world of Boho chic. This picture captures the essence of Boho girls, showcasing their unique Boho outfits that perfectly blend fashion and comfort. The Bohemian style clothing, with its rich patterns and flowing designs, is a testament to the Hippie style. The Gypsy style elements add an exotic touch, making each outfit a piece of art. Experience the allure of Boho style fashion, where every outfit tells a story of freedom, individuality, and creativity.', '', 'https://www.pinterest.com/pin/11118330326836433', 'https://i.pinimg.com/originals/a5/7d/50/a57d5054c8406ffc4de3146d63cee47d.jpg', '60x60: https://i.pinimg.com/60x60/a5/7d/50/a57d5054c8406ffc4de3146d63cee47d.jpg\n136x136: https://i.pinimg.com/136x136/a5/7d/50/a57d5054c8406ffc4de3146d63cee47d.jpg\n170x: https://i.pinimg.com/236x/a5/7d/50/a57d5054c8406ffc4de3146d63cee47d.jpg\n236x: https://i.pinimg.com/236x/a5/7d/50/a57d5054c8406ffc4de3146d63cee47d.jpg\n474x: https://i.pinimg.com/474x/a5/7d/50/a57d5054c8406ffc4de3146d63cee47d.jpg\n564x: https://i.pinimg.com/564x/a5/7d/50/a57d5054c8406ffc4de3146d63cee47d.jpg\n736x: https://i.pinimg.com/736x/a5/7d/50/a57d5054c8406ffc4de3146d63cee47d.jpg\n600x315: https://i.pinimg.com/600x315/a5/7d/50/a57d5054c8406ffc4de3146d63cee47d.jpg\norig: https://i.pinimg.com/originals/a5/7d/50/a57d5054c8406ffc4de3146d63cee47d.jpg', '', '', '', 760, 0, '34', 437, 0, 0, 10, 'Boho', 'https://www.pinterest.com/ampogue01/boho/', 0, 0, '', 'public', '', 'Dream a lil Dream', 'ampogue01', 'https://www.pinterest.com/ampogue01', 0, 0, 1473, 0, '', '', '', '', '2024-03-04T04:28:14.000Z', '2026-06-23T17:21:37.879Z', '', 'created', 0, ''),
