('1112107701755510039', 'Simple and cute tropical y2k summer outfits for vacations', 'Getting ready for a trip is easier with these tropical y2k summer outfits. This style is all about having fun with your clothes while keeping things light for the heat. You can find inspiration for skirts and tops that feature palm trees and bright flowers. These outfits are perfect for pictures or just hanging out by the pool. We explain how to pick the right fabrics so you stay cool while looking trendy. These fashion choices are easy to pack and wear for any summer plan you have this year.\n#TropicalStyle #Y2KFashion #SummerOutfits #VacationLooks #CuteOutfits #SimpleFashion #Y2KSummer #TropicalVibes #BeachFashion #SummerVacation #TropicalOutfits #Y2KStyle #SummerStyle #VacationStyle #TropicalY2K #CuteSummer #SimpleOutfits #Y2KVacation #SummerTrends #TropicalFashion', '', 'https://www.pinterest.com/pin/1112107701755510039', 'https://i.pinimg.com/originals/8c/ae/b4/8caeb4bb5b51d0ffff2e9061dba09fea.jpg', '60x60: https://i.pinimg.com/60x60/8c/ae/b4/8caeb4bb5b51d0ffff2e9061dba09fea.jpg\n136x136: https://i.pinimg.com/136x136/8c/ae/b4/8caeb4bb5b51d0ffff2e9061dba09fea.jpg\n170x: https://i.pinimg.com/236x/8c/ae/b4/8caeb4bb5b51d0ffff2e9061dba09fea.jpg\n236x: https://i.pinimg.com/236x/8c/ae/b4/8caeb4bb5b51d0ffff2e9061dba09fea.jpg\n474x: https://i.pinimg.com/474x/8c/ae/b4/8caeb4bb5b51d0ffff2e9061dba09fea.jpg\n564x: https://i.pinimg.com/564x/8c/ae/b4/8caeb4bb5b51d0ffff2e9061dba09fea.jpg\n736x: https://i.pinimg.com/736x/8c/ae/b4/8caeb4bb5b51d0ffff2e9061dba09fea.jpg\n600x315: https://i.pinimg.com/600x315/8c/ae/b4/8caeb4bb5b51d0ffff2e9061dba09fea.jpg\norig: https://i.pinimg.com/originals/8c/ae/b4/8caeb4bb5b51d0ffff2e9061dba09fea.jpg', '', '', '', 1, 0, '0', 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Fashion and Lifestyle', 'https://www.pinterest.com/sparvin7678/fashion-and-lifestyle/', 0, 0, '', 'public', '', 'Design with Salma', 'sparvin7678', 'https://www.pinterest.com/sparvin7678', 0, 0, 108, 0, '', '', '', '', '2026-04-