('1112389176728242583', 'Savory French Onion Gnocchi Bake with Golden Caramelized Onions', 'What makes this French onion Soup Pasta with caramelized onions so incredibly cozy, rich, and irresistible when the weather cools down? This creamy and bubbly skillet bake delivers all the deep, savory flavors of classic French onion soup in a comforting pasta-style dish that is perfect for fall dinners, winter gatherings, or holiday hosting. The tender gnocchi, golden onions, and melty cheese come together in a way that feels both simple and indulgent for any weeknight. Save this if you love...', '', 'https://www.pinterest.com/pin/1112389176728242583', 'https://i.pinimg.com/originals/a1/2e/e1/a12ee11efc1dd49a1844072c3476a4ce.jpg', '60x60: https://i.pinimg.com/60x60/a1/2e/e1/a12ee11efc1dd49a1844072c3476a4ce.jpg\n136x136: https://i.pinimg.com/136x136/a1/2e/e1/a12ee11efc1dd49a1844072c3476a4ce.jpg\n170x: https://i.pinimg.com/236x/a1/2e/e1/a12ee11efc1dd49a1844072c3476a4ce.jpg\n236x: https://i.pinimg.com/236x/a1/2e/e1/a12ee11efc1dd49a1844072c3476a4ce.jpg\n474x: https://i.pinimg.com/474x/a1/2e/e1/a12ee11efc1dd49a1844072c3476a4ce.jpg\n564x: https://i.pinimg.com/564x/a1/2e/e1/a12ee11efc1dd49a1844072c3476a4ce.jpg\n736x: https://i.pinimg.com/736x/a1/2e/e1/a12ee11efc1dd49a1844072c3476a4ce.jpg\n600x315: https://i.pinimg.com/600x315/a1/2e/e1/a12ee11efc1dd49a1844072c3476a4ce.jpg\norig: https://i.pinimg.com/originals/a1/2e/e1/a12ee11efc1dd49a1844072c3476a4ce.jpg', '', '', '', 3212, 0, '16', 2067, 2, 0, 50, 'Good Food', 'https://www.pinterest.com/norawynncooks/good-food/', 0, 0, '', 'public', 'food_drink', 'SLS Recipes by Nora Wynn | Easy Comfort Food & Family Meals', 'norawynncooks', 'https://www.pinterest.com/norawynncooks', 0, 0, 321, 0, '', '', '', '', '2026-02-09T12:59:53.000Z', '2026-06-23T16:43:18.572Z', '', 'created', 0, ''),
('1112389176735078231', 'Boho Beach Bandana Outfit for Summer 2026 — Hippie Chic Vacation Look Girls', 'Channel full boho beach goddess energy with a triangle bandana worn as a bikini top or layered over a strappy swimsuit, paired with crochet cover-up shorts, beaded anklets, and leather thong sandals. A flowy oversized bandana shoulder wrap keeps the vibe effortless for sunset strolls. This hippie chic beach look is perfect for Tulum, Bali, Mykonos, or your local shore this summer. Stack those shell necklaces and own the sand. 🌊🌴\n#BohoBandanaBeach #BeachBandanaOutfit #HippieChicSummer #BohoBeachLook #BandanoBikiniTop #BeachBohoStyle #TulumOutfitIdeas #CrochetCoverUp #BeachBandanaVibes #SummerBeachGirlOutfit', 'https://amzn.to/4f3IyYH', 'https://www.pinterest.com/pin/1112389176735078231', 'https://i.pinimg.com/originals/40/7a/ca/407aca0ba8325c7206046dcd00b4a3f4.png', '60x60: https://i.pinimg.com/60x60/40/7a/ca/407aca0ba8325c7206046dcd00b4a3f4.jpg\n136x136: https://i.pinimg.com/136x136/40/7a/ca/407aca0ba8325c7206046dcd00b4a3f4.jpg\n170x: https://i.pinimg.com/236x/40/7a/ca/407aca0ba8325c7206046dcd00b4a3f4.jpg\n236x: https://i.pinimg.com/236x/40/7a/ca/407aca0ba8325c7206046dcd00b4a3f4.jpg\n474x: https://i.pinimg.com/474x/40/7a/ca/407aca0ba8325c7206046dcd00b4a3f4.jpg\n564x: https://i.pinimg.com/564x/40/7a/ca/407aca0ba8325c7206046dcd00b4a3f4.jpg\n736x: https://i.pinimg.com/736x/40/7a/ca/407aca0ba8325c7206046dcd00b4a3f4.jpg\n600x315: https://i.pinimg.com/600x315/40/7a/ca/407aca0ba8325c7206046dcd00b4a3f4.jpg\norig: https://i.pinimg.com/originals/40/7a/ca/407aca0ba8325c7206046dcd00b4a3f4.png', '', '', '', 2, 0, '0', 1, 0, 0, 0, 'Soft Girl Fashion Outfits & Aesthetic Style Guide', 'https://www.pinterest.com/softgirlfashiondiary/soft-girl-fashion-outfits-aesthetic-style-guide/', 0, 0, '', 'public', '', 'Soft Girl Fashion Outfit Diary', 'softgirlfashiondiary', 'https://www.pinterest.com/softgirlfashiondiary', 0, 0, 1, 0, '', '', '', '', '2026-05-26T10:40:25.000Z', '2026-06-23T