('1124422231987781787', '“Boho Beach Outfit 🌊 | Perfect Summer Vacation Look for Women”', 'This dreamy boho beach outfit is the perfect summer vacation look. Featuring a crochet halter top paired with soft beige shorts, layered jewelry, and effortless styling, this outfit captures a relaxed yet chic coastal vibe. Ideal for beach walks, travel photos, or aesthetic Pinterest inspiration, this look blends comfort with elegance. Save this outfit idea for your next summer getaway! \n#SummerOutfit #BeachOutfit #BohoStyle #VacationLook #PinterestStyle #OutfitInspo #AestheticVibes #TravelOutfit #SummerFashion #WomenStyle #OOTD #StyleInspiration #TrendingOutfits #BeachVibes #CoastalStyle', '', 'https://www.pinterest.com/pin/1124422231987781787', 'https://i.pinimg.com/originals/53/5b/d7/535bd749811739ebc5aa8d42511fea29.png', '60x60: https://i.pinimg.com/60x60/53/5b/d7/535bd749811739ebc5aa8d42511fea29.jpg\n136x136: https://i.pinimg.com/136x136/53/5b/d7/535bd749811739ebc5aa8d42511fea29.jpg\n170x: https://i.pinimg.com/236x/53/5b/d7/535bd749811739ebc5aa8d42511fea29.jpg\n236x: https://i.pinimg.com/236x/53/5b/d7/535bd749811739ebc5aa8d42511fea29.jpg\n474x: https://i.pinimg.com/474x/53/5b/d7/535bd749811739ebc5aa8d42511fea29.jpg\n564x: https://i.pinimg.com/564x/53/5b/d7/535bd749811739ebc5aa8d42511fea29.jpg\n736x: https://i.pinimg.com/736x/53/5b/d7/535bd749811739ebc5aa8d42511fea29.jpg\n600x315: https://i.pinimg.com/600x315/53/5b/d7/535bd749811739ebc5aa8d42511fea29.jpg\norig: https://i.pinimg.com/originals/53/5b/d7/535bd749811739ebc5aa8d42511fea29.png', '', '', '', 21, 0, '3', 10, 0, 0, 0, 'summer shorts 2026', 'https://www.pinterest.com/aryaraj_zala007/summer-shorts-2026/', 0, 0, '', 'public', '', 'Urban Chic Styles', 'aryaraj_zala007', 'https://www.pinterest.com/aryaraj_zala007', 0, 0, 6, 0, '', '', '', '', '2026-03-19T04:26:00.000Z', '2026-06-23T17:25:38.751Z', '', 'created', 0, ''),
