('980799625116780424', '🥜🍫 Peanut & Chocolate Bonbons – Creamy, Keto-Friendly & Freezer-Ready! By: @chiara.fiorani', '📊 Estimated Macros (per bonbon, est. – makes 5):\nCalories: ~60 | Fat: ~5 g | Protein: ~2.8 g | Net Carbs: ~1.5 g\n\nIngredients (Makes 5 bonbons):\n⅔ cup full-fat Greek yogurt (150 g)\n1 tbsp peanut butter (15 g)\n1 tbsp cocoa powder (8 g)\nKeto-friendly sweetener, to taste (I used sugar-free maple syrup, about 1–2 tsp / 5–10 ml)\nTopping:\nSugar-free dark chocolate, melted (about 1 oz / 30 g)\n\nInstructions:\nIn a bowl, combine the Greek yogurt, peanut butter, cocoa powder, and sweetener until smooth.\nSpoon or shape the mixture into bonbons and place them on a parchment-lined tray.\nFreeze for at least 4 hours, until fully firm.\nDip the frozen bonbons into the melted sugar-free dark chocolate.\nReturn to the freezer or fridge until the chocolate sets, then enjoy! 🫶🏼\n. #chocolatebonbons', '', 'https://www.pinterest.com/pin/980799625116780424', 'https://i.pinimg.com/736x/2b/ef/e9/2befe97f414c70d302c25c354d94fd49.jpg', '2befe97f414c70d302c25c354d94fd49', '0', '', '', 6062, 0, '{"1": 247}', 3299, 17, 0, 102, 'Low Carb Dessert', '/Eathealthyisgood/low-carb-dessert/', 0, 0, '', 'public', '', 'Eat Healthy is Good | Keto Diet, Low Carb Recipes', 'Eathealthyisgood', 'https://www.pinterest.com/Eathealthyisgood/', 0, 0, 15041, 0, '', '', '', '', 'Sat, 17 Jan 2026 12:28:51 +0000', '2026-06-24 14:24:44.968000', '980799693788237335', 'created', 0, '{"ads_only_profile_site": null, "image_medium_url": "https://i.pinimg.com/75x75_RS/b3/41/d3/b341d34be82ebf36e9b43529aed3cba0.jpg", "instagram_data": {"username": "low.carb.jiji", "has_invalid_instagram_auth": false, "url": "https://www.instagram.com/low.carb.jiji"}, "is_default_image": false, "is_verified_merchant": false, "indexed": true, "domain_verified": true, "full_name": "Eat Healthy is Good | Keto Diet, Low Carb Recipes", "is_ads_only_profile": false, "image_small_url": "https://i.pinimg.com/30x30_RS/b3/41/